    "detailed_description": "LineMaze is one of the most creative puzzle game for your brain.<br />\r\nThis brain-stimulating puzzle game , very simple, and enjoyable for all ages.<br />\r\nYou can refresh your skills anytime you want.<br />\r\nTry LineMaze, enjoy challenging gameplay, brightening your mind, be smart and relax with a beautiful background melody.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnjoying in brain exercise with  LineMaze, where you will be able to play an addictive puzzles, an awesome brain stimulation. If you love playing Sudoku or 2048, you will love LineMaze for sure!!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHow to play LineMaze: the super addictive puzzle game<br />\r\nAfter you start playing LineMaze you will get a set of tiles on your screen where you need to find a pathway by creating tile path following few simple rules:<br />\r\n- You need to find the correct path from gate to gate within the tiles.<br />\r\n- You are not allowed to visit a tile twice.<br />\r\n- You have to visit all tiles.<br />\r\n- The entrance and exit cannot be at the same gate.<br />\r\n- There is only one correct path to solve the puzzle.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey features:<br />\r\n- Easy to understand with flat user interface.<br />\r\n- You can play more than 1000 levels to challenge yourself and your own brain.<br />\r\n- You can pause a game, resuming your gameplay where you have left it before.<br />\r\n- You can play this addictive puzzle game in Three level-settings: Easy, Medium, Hard. Each level has multiple stage with an increasing challenge.",
